        "subject": "LU-10026 csdc: distinguish the -Z none parameter for DoM",
        "message": "LU-10026 csdc: distinguish the -Z none parameter for DoM\n\nWhen \"-Z none\" is passed, LOV_PATTERN_COMPRESS is set\nwith LL_COMPR_TYPE_SPEC_NONE, this is how this case\ncan be distinguished for DoM with compression\nprevention.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-13161\nSigned-off-by: Artem Blagodarenko <ablagodarenko@ddn.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I0718af523efe2952b844e2d474acc1c02493303a\n"
      },
